@FastFashionCatalogSync.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5240

### Preview the latest approved merchandising catalog
GET {{FastFashionCatalogSync.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog-releases/preview/latest
Accept: application/json

### Schedule a catalog release after copying the fingerprint from the preview response
POST {{FastFashionCatalogSync.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog-releases/schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchandisingVersionId": "SS26-DROP-02",
  "scheduledFor": "2026-05-07T23:00:00Z",
  "requestedBy": "catalog-admin@retail.com",
  "previewFingerprint": "replace-with-preview-fingerprint"
}

### Inspect release ledger
GET {{FastFashionCatalogSync.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog-releases
Accept: application/json

### Execute due catalog releases
POST {{FastFashionCatalogSync.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog-releases/execute-due
Accept: application/json
